C/ Isolates 167-ASSORTEDIO.hal's structure-INITIAL()-with-a-NULL-terminal
C/ construct (the file itself also uses a %SVC macro invocation later,
C/ which is deliberately out of this interpreter's scope, so it can't be
C/ used verbatim here) -- a WRITE statement added to check the numeric/
C/ BIT terminals coalesced around the NULL terminal came through intact.

  T167: PROGRAM;
     STRUCTURE IOPARM:
        1 DEVICE INTEGER,
        1 STATUS BIT(16),
        1 BUFFER NAME ARRAY(10) INTEGER,
        1 WORDS INTEGER;
     DECLARE FWDSENSORS IOPARM-STRUCTURE INITIAL(16, HEX'0', NULL, 27);
     WRITE(6) FWDSENSORS.DEVICE, FWDSENSORS.STATUS, FWDSENSORS.WORDS;
Y %SVCI(0);
  CLOSE T167;
